"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/7c604da7d4e672a77fc63b5a58f35028.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/37c24955a297517853b7ef327d8a10e9.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/37c24955a297517853b7ef327d8a10e9.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/37c24955a297517853b7ef327d8a10e9.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monitor and Manage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the ship from a high level while managing the nitty-gritty details of daily life aboard. Build, assign, and optimize while your passengers work around the clock. Mine asteroids, construct essential buildings, and balance productivity with happiness. All while making sure there will even be a next generation. A mix of active and idle gameplay lets you play the game as a second-monitor experience or dive in for full micromanagement on your main screen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intuitive Building System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build nearly two dozen different buildings that all serve a specific purpose inside the generation ship. Mine passing asteroids to create resources and tools to keep the generations growing. Keep the security and happiness up to increase the passengers efficiency and hopefully lower the chances of bad things happening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/98bc9a5768aba93b2e21758bdff211df.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/98bc9a5768aba93b2e21758bdff211df.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/98bc9a5768aba93b2e21758bdff211df.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign passengers to conduct scientific research to gain upgrades and enact harsh social policies. You don't want to keep half of your population tilling the soil in the farms do you?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/4ed1130578ee060e5a475026b3033142.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/4ed1130578ee060e5a475026b3033142.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/4ed1130578ee060e5a475026b3033142.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Event And Task System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your playstyle: Make harsh decisions and be a tyrant or be liberal and try to help as much as possible. In the end only thing that matters is that the generations will live on. Make the elders work or let them enjoy their last moments of their life in peace. Encounter problems with material and resource malfunctions and order passengers to fix the issue even at the cost of their life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/c4ef075c863bcb86bde9460872c128b8.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/c4ef075c863bcb86bde9460872c128b8.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/c4ef075c863bcb86bde9460872c128b8.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passenger AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The passengers have been through a lot by just waking up in the ship. Social problems will eventually occur and everything will take a toll on their psyche. Manage their happiness and hope to keep the needed production lines going. You don't want to end up with no tools to mine the asteroids. And you definitely don't want the food to run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/adbc8b02ba331d4406754eabb4f154b6.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/adbc8b02ba331d4406754eabb4f154b6.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/adbc8b02ba331d4406754eabb4f154b6.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting Zone System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on where you are flying through the space the passengers of the ship might get more creative and faster in work. But pass a dark void or a nebula and the problems might start piling up. Hopefully the hull will not be breached in the asteroid field. Plan in advance to go on a resource production spree when you know the passengers are willing to do the extra work and give them the breaks they need when times seem most dire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/cc604f4b4b1124eb3c70e145b234048a.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/cc604f4b4b1124eb3c70e145b234048a.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/cc604f4b4b1124eb3c70e145b234048a.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Music Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over an hour of atmospheric and original music tracks made by Markus Brogaard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Home... This is our new home for now. Maybe one day at least the children of the future will breath unfiltered air.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/7bd1165a39f0c787dedc15e0e2c406a7.poster.avif?t=1768909675\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/7bd1165a39f0c787dedc15e0e2c406a7.webm?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/extras/7bd1165a39f0c787dedc15e0e2c406a7.mp4?t=1768909675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["OatCube Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618390/bb2ef4288d79ec5f6de0a2da17fbc9d9990a5ecf/header.jpg?t=1768909675","is_free":false,"linux_re